# Captured practice runs ARE committed (~2 MB total). They are the evidence
# base for every finding in LOGIC.md and they make the analysis reproducible:
#   python tools/diagnose.py captures/<run>.jsonl --check
# re-grades the current code against a real graded run without spending a
# practice attempt. Scored-mode captures are excluded -- they are larger and
# carry no diagnostics.
